---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import LegalArticle from '../components/LegalArticle.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title='Support - Moss'
  description='Get help with Moss: bugs, sign-in, subscriptions, subscriptions and privacy.'
>
  <LegalArticle title='Support'>
    <h2>Email support</h2>
    <p>
      Send questions, bug reports and feedback to{' '}
      <a href='mailto:support@getmoss.app?subject=Moss%20Support'
        >support@getmoss.app</a
      >. Include the email address on your Moss account and a short description
      of what you need. Moss is developed and supported by Kyle Scudder.
    </p>

    <h2>Report a bug or request a feature</h2>
    <p>
      Tell us what you did, what you expected, and what happened instead. A
      screenshot helps.
    </p>

    <h2>Sign-in and account questions</h2>
    <p>
      Moss supports email, Apple, and Google sign-in. Password resets and
      provider account access are handled by the provider you use to sign in.
      To delete your account, use the account deletion option in Settings, or
      email <a href='mailto:support@getmoss.app'>support@getmoss.app</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Subscription questions</h2>
    <p>
      Moss subscriptions are managed through your Apple ID. You can manage or
      cancel a subscription in your App Store account settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy questions</h2>
    <p>
      Start with the <a href='/privacy'>privacy policy</a>. Anything it does not
      answer can be raised by email.
    </p>
  </LegalArticle>
</BaseLayout>
